    <system:String x:Key="VideoDetailStatusAddUnavailable">未能建立下載任務；下載服務沒有返回結果。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadSelected">下載選中項</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="AddAllToDownload">下載全部</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAlreadyToAddDownloading">此內容已加入下載佇列，無需重複新增。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAlreadyToAddDownloaded">已經下載完成~</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAddDownloadingZero">沒有選中項符合下載要求！</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAddDownloadingUnavailable">所選內容目前沒有可下載的資源。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAddDownloadingSkippedByChoice">已按你的選擇跳過下載。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAddDownloadingFailed">新增下載任務失敗。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAddDownloadingUnsupportedInput">當前輸入無法建立下載任務。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAddDownloadingCanceled">已取消新增下載任務。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAddDownloadingCanceledAfterProgress">{0} 操作隨後取消。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAddDownloadingSelectionUnavailable">下載目錄不可用，未新增任務。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAddDownloadingSummary">新增 {0} 項；重複 {1} 項，跳過 {2} 項，失敗 {3} 項。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAddDownloadingNoAddedSummary">未新增任務；重複 {0} 項，跳過 {1} 項，失敗 {2} 項。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAddDownloadingFinished1">成功新增了</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAddDownloadingFinished2">項~</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAddDownloadingFinishedWithSkipped">成功新增了 {0} 項，跳過了 {1} 個不可用專案。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="TipAddDownloadingSkipped">跳過了 {1} 個不可用專案，沒有新增下載項。</system:String>

    <!--  DownloadManager  -->
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadTaskColumn">影片與規格</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadTransferColumn">進度 / 傳輸</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadCompletedColumn">完成時間</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadActionsColumn">操作</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadQueueLabel">佇列</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadCompletedLabel">已完成</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadTaskUnit">項</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadQueueEmptyTitle">佇列為空</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadQueueEmptyHint">下載完成的任務會移到右上角「已下載」。若剛剛新增了影片，請在那裡檢視或開啟檔案。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadHistoryEmptyTitle">還沒有已完成的下載</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadHistoryEmptyHint">下載完成後，可以在這裡播放影片、開啟資料夾或整理記錄。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Downloading">正在下載</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFinished">已下載</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadSuccess">下載完成</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadingAudio">音訊</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadingVideo">影片</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadingDanmaku">彈幕</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadingSubtitle">字幕</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadingCover">封面</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Parsing">正在解析……</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="WhileDownloading">下載中……</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="MixedFlow">混流中……</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="ConcatVideos">影片合併中……</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Pausing">暫停中……</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Paused">已暫停</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Waiting">等待中……</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailed">下載失敗</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureDetails">檢視原因</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="HideFailureDetails">收起原因</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureCode">錯誤程式碼</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureUnknownCode">未知</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureUnavailableDetails">請求的畫質、音軌或其他內容目前不可用。請重新解析並建立任務，選擇當前可用的內容；原任務的選擇不會因重試而改變。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureRateLimitDetails">伺服器暫時限制請求。請稍後再點“重試”，不要連續重複提交。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureAccessDetails">伺服器拒絕了下載請求。請檢查登入狀態和內容訪問許可權；持續失敗時可重新解析並選擇其他畫質。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureCoverAccessDetails">伺服器拒絕了封面請求。請稍後重試；持續失敗時請重新建立任務，或取消封面選項。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureArtifactAccessDetails">伺服器拒絕了附加檔案請求。請檢查登入狀態和內容訪問許可權後重試；持續失敗時請重新建立任務，或取消對應的附加檔案選項。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureExpiredAddressDetails">下載地址已失效或被伺服器拒絕。程式已經嘗試切換並重新整理地址；請重新解析並建立任務。持續失敗時請檢查登入狀態和內容訪問許可權。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureNetworkDetails">網路連線或伺服器響應中斷。請檢查網路和代理設定，然後點“重試”。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureStorageDetails">本機下載檔案無法寫入或清理，或與現有檔案衝突。請檢查下載目錄權限、剩餘空間與同名檔案，再點「重試」。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureInvalidOutputDetails">下載結果未透過完整性檢查。可點“重試”；若同一內容持續失敗，請重新解析並嘗試其他畫質。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureSubtitleDetails">所選字幕未能完成下載。可點“重試”；若字幕已不可用，請重新建立任務並調整字幕選擇。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureArtifactDetails">附加檔案未能完成下載。請檢查網路和下載目錄後重試；持續失敗時可在“設定 → 關於與反饋”匯出診斷包。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureProcessingDetails">下載後的檔案處理未完成。可點“重試”；持續失敗時可在“設定 → 關於與反饋”匯出診斷包。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureTlsDetails">安全連線驗證失敗。請檢查系統日期、代理和證書設定，然後再重試。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureRuntimeDetails">下載服務無法繼續執行。請重新啟動應用；若仍失敗，請在“設定 → 關於與反饋”匯出診斷包。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureLegacyDetails">此任務使用已移除的舊下載器，無法直接重試。請重新解析並建立任務。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailurePublicationRecoveryDetails">上次檔案釋出的狀態無法安全確認，當前任務不能直接重試。請確認同名檔案後刪除此失敗任務，再重新解析並建立任務。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailurePublishedArtifactDetails">已釋出的下載檔案已缺失或損壞，原任務不能直接重試。若損壞的同名檔案仍存在，請先將它移走或刪除；再刪除此失敗任務，重新解析並建立任務。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadFailureGenericDetails">暫時無法判斷具體原因。可點“重試”；若再次失敗，請在“設定 → 關於與反饋”匯出診斷包。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="SubtitleDownloadFailed">字幕下載失敗</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadRuntimeUnavailable">下載服務啟動失敗，請重新啟動應用並檢視日誌。</system:String>
