    <system:String x:Key="DownloadContentConflictMessage">“{0}”無法完全符合原下載設定。請接受實際可取得的內容和品質，或跳過這一頁。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="UseAvailableDownloadContent">使用{0}繼續下載</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="VideoQualitySubstitution">畫質：{0} → {1}</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="AudioQualitySubstitution">音質：{0} → {1}</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="QualitySubstitutionSeparator">；</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadAudioAndVideo">音訊和影片</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="SkipDownloadPage">跳過此頁</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="ApplyToAllSameContentConflict">應用到具有相同衝突的所有頁面</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="ApplyToAllQualitySubstitution">一鍵確定</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="ApplyToAllQualitySubstitutionExplanation">「一鍵確定」表示對本次批次中的每一集，分別使用該集實際可取得、最接近原設定的替代品質。&#x000A;&#x000A;不同集數可能使用不同畫質或音質，不會強制全部使用相同品質，也不會增加原本未勾選的下載內容。&#x000A;&#x000A;使用者仍可選擇跳過下載。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadQualityBatchTitle">下載品質需要確認</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadQualityBatchMessage">本次下載清單中有 {0} 部影片無法取得偏好品質。確認後會依下列實際品質下載。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadQualityBatchGroup">{0}（{1} 部）</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadQualityBatchAffectedItems">檢視受影響的 {0} 部影片</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="DownloadQualityBatchSettingsHint">若經常出現此提醒，可到「設定 → 影片」調整優先下載畫質與音質。</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="UseAvailableQualityBatch">依清單品質下載（{0} 部）</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="SkipQualityBatch">略過這 {0} 部</system:String>


